Package: intlimiter
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: iproute2, bc
Maintainer: oluxid536 <oluxid536@example.com>
Description: Simple network bandwidth limiter
 A command-line tool to limit download and upload speeds
 on Linux network interfaces using traffic control (tc).
 Supports both megabits and megabytes per second.
